# A lead starts workers: the row names each one, its task and model from the moment of the
# call, and the other agent tools draw the agents they reach as pills.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer paneImage null
replies spawn-row.json
project storefront shop
chat Mira
title "Order emails"
say "Hand the receipt template to a worker."
settle 2
chat Wren
title "Cart total bug"
say "Get a worker on the cart total bug and tell Mira it's covered."
settle 12
front Mira
settle 1
snap spawn-starting
front Wren
settle 2
snap spawn-started
